## 3. Frameworks & Libraries

**Frontend stack**

- Vue 3 + TypeScript (`resources/js/app.ts`), Pinia for state, Vue Router for navigation, Axios for API access, Tailwind CSS v4 for styling.
- Vite handles bundling, alias resolution (`@ -> resources/js`), SSR manifest emission, and dev server HMR on port 5173.
- Testing uses Vitest + Vue Test Utils; Playwright covers e2e flows.

