## 7. Project Structure

- Canonical structure is documented in `README-FRONTEND.md` (excerpt below). Match this layout when adding pages that correspond to Figma screens so router lazy-loaded chunks remain predictable.

```110:139:README-FRONTEND.md
resources/js/
├── app.ts                    # Application entry point
├── App.vue                   # Root component
├── lib/
│   └── axios.ts             # Axios configuration
├── stores/
│   ├── auth.ts              # Authentication store
│   ├── tenant.ts            # Tenant store
│   └── superadmin.ts        # Superadmin store
├── router/
│   └── index.ts             # Vue Router configuration
├── pages/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   └── LoginPage.vue
│   ├── admin/
│   │   ├── auth/
│   │   │   └── LoginPage.vue
│   │   └── tenants/
│   │       ├── TenantsListPage.vue
│   │       ├── TenantCreatePage.vue
│   │       └── TenantEditPage.vue
├── components/
│   └── TenantSwitcher.vue
